{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "514ad6749cf89765ade1238e13ff5725ba33591bdd1f4d0bc8008407a593b4b9", "ja": "自分たちだからできること", "zh": "正是因为我们才能做到的事", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "a734a57b12163ba0427e0c7034c3219d2ad41d8d4c1bf7b07c1670fbc131851c", "ja": "稽古を通して役と自分の共通点を見出した歩\nは、だからこそリイチをカッコよく演じたい\nと話す。それを聞いた麗花は、改めてプロ\nデューサーの元を訪ねると、自身の役である\nチトセと友達になりたいと話す。", "zh": "通过排练发现了自己和角色共同点的步，正因为如此，她说想把利一演得帅气。听到这话后，丽花再次来到制作人身边，说自己想和饰演的角色千岁成为朋友。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1000_048rei", "source_sha256": "9d5be36b6b028c6dff61e3db661eca73e46276bf914418c94b709719099c96f0", "ja": "どう考えても悪手だ。逃げ切りに徹した方がいい……\nアンタこれまでのこと、全部ムダにするつもりかよ！", "zh": "不管怎么想，这都是一步臭棋。还是彻底逃到底比较好……  \n你打算把之前的一切全都白费了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1001_034ayu", "source_sha256": "646d5c90fd784d36a012592a52ef2e53fa07de4045bd4b40735fc57cea8ab00d", "ja": "バーカ、命の張りどころの間違いだろ？　ここで勝負を\n降りたら、オレがオレじゃなくなっちまうからな！", "zh": "笨蛋，你拼命的地方搞错了吧？要是在这里放弃较量，我就不再是我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "41284c23177c826e6a3e879395c7576e327efe8d53052ee4881ab5d8d06bc3fd", "ja": "（撮影開始、前日。歩と麗花に頼まれて、\nふたりの自主練習に立ち合っている……）", "zh": "（开拍前一天。受步和丽花拜托，正在陪着她们进行自主练习……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1003_034ayu", "source_sha256": "effeb31ae2143ba860f927c0cbd85d7ead785d9e7dca0898a47edb0baf98d5ce", "ja": "ふぅ～……{$P$}！\n今の、どうだった？", "zh": "呼～……{$P$}！\n刚才怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "150d8d057cf902f47e6dbc780d6d7f193c46625a9532b0d45a54828f5ddb308d", "ja": "うん、前よりも良くなったと思う。\n監督の言っていたギャップが、際立った感じだな。", "zh": "嗯，我觉得比之前更好了。\n导演说的反差感，感觉已经突显出来了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "83f6280464e969c5fa49de60925bd131270e0e3be0eb0487ceb89712c619728d", "ja": "うんうん！　あゆあゆのリイチ、\nすっごくカッコイイよ♪　どうしたら、そうなったの？", "zh": "嗯嗯！步步演的利一，真的超帅气♪是怎么做到的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9612fd737accfe8c28e7928044c809a3cfc0c98183ee954d607ebb8a7d968fe1", "ja": "う～ん、そうだな。アタシなりにだけど、リイチに\n向き合ってみたというか……いろいろ考えてみたんだ。", "zh": "嗯～，怎么说呢。虽然只是按照自己的方式，但我试着去面对利一……也思考了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fe94521cc67ae0fd5e3f1055892604342bb811214a6dd244270e5738061b833a", "ja": "役の事を考えるのは、何より大事だからな。\n歩は、リイチの事が理解できたのか？", "zh": "琢磨角色是最重要的嘛。\n步理解利一了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1008_034ayu", "source_sha256": "9d75e97792cf04df5e312e5671917ad116ca704192affb6e2e0a60e8b6d94f99", "ja": "理解っていうか……リイチって凄腕のギャンブラーで、\nすっごい豪運の持ち主でしょ？", "zh": "与其说是理解……利一不是个很厉害的赌徒，还特别走运吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "90a4a1602c5e65aed60f50eb4c0f5ebd47f4bdc0104e657e9c24c89b49ce0077", "ja": "だから、アタシとは全然違うんだけど……アタシなんて\n今朝も家出た瞬間、靴紐がほどけちゃったし。", "zh": "所以说，虽然和我完全不一样……我这种人啊，今天早上刚一出门，鞋带就散了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "95036dd1c6cdc7c0f6a4ef57f2ca2bffd995c5b22a0777aee98e337398a9d4e7", "ja": "慌てて結ぼうとしたらカバンの中身が全部落ちて、\n結果、乗ろうとした電車が目の前で行っちゃって……。", "zh": "我慌忙想把鞋带系好，结果包里的东西全掉出来了，最后眼睁睁看着本来要乘的电车从面前开走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "af8ed52efda69358b1ef266a32d6d2ab15d20c8ac3aeadb482fcd8309640caaf", "ja": "そ、そうか。災難だったな……。", "zh": "原、原来如此。真是够倒霉的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "8cc06581f96f05b84d595c3bcc8d2e1f76e9bf9cc71f485b2df8c2de27579c88", "ja": "あゆあゆは、今日も元気にあゆあゆしてるね♪\nそういうところも、とってもカワイイと思うな。", "zh": "步步今天也是活力满满的步步呢♪\n我觉得这样的地方也很可爱哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1013_034ayu", "source_sha256": "221f2ef10213bfee342da8fbf60579b174be216d4db0293262611a9a9e409669", "ja": "全然フォローになってないんだけど……\nまぁ、それはともかく。", "zh": "完全没有起到安慰作用嘛……\n不过，先不说这个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3b5c78e72cffffd2ace4afdacfb97ff194d9c23c05a3c73647d30e12645e82fd", "ja": "リイチは世界一のギャンブラーになる夢を持っててさ。\nそういう熱いところは、アタシと同じかもって。", "zh": "利一有着成为世界第一赌徒的梦想。那种热血的一面，可能和我很像吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1015_p", "source_sha256": "732ce5e8fab066f70b77b62d4c4a5a7ed6d8881ff8e3b9d32d922d27e26dbf10", "ja": "そうだな。歩は世界一のダンスアイドルになるために\n日々頑張っているもんな。", "zh": "是啊。步为了成为世界第一的舞蹈偶像，每天都在努力呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1016_034ayu", "source_sha256": "88f93098669b5dd2c6d9da270f864ad3826c3bb2099118649499d75df113c8ee", "ja": "うん。そう思ったら、\n親近感が湧いたっていうのかな？", "zh": "嗯。这样一想，感觉就产生亲近感了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "3269d09bdd162c16b70d985071e3a86dc94ca1645828f3bb0b904ebecd9be84c", "ja": "リイチは今、運の強さだけじゃ乗り越えられないことに\n立ち向かってる……それって、すごくカッコイイよね。", "zh": "利一现在正面对着仅凭运气无法克服的事情……这真的很帅气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1018_034ayu", "source_sha256": "b9feb875ad41d15a74fdf383e752abdc24ba2bf9c55004e21f37ef490244f726", "ja": "だから、できるだけカッコよく演じたい！\n……ってね♪", "zh": "所以，我想尽可能帅气地演绎出来！\n……我是这么想的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1019_034ayu", "source_sha256": "f7d4c9e89a72c326cb91a1f6b1e8b436f931379315788f4602117342d29e65b6", "ja": "まあ、そうは言ってもアタシだから。\nどこまでできるかはわからないけど……えへへ。", "zh": "不过，话虽如此，毕竟是我嘛。能做到什么程度我也不知道……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "f43ab6f29515412c10b7c51181d74c8f9cb29035af5d121a88194c21446c4304", "ja": "いや。その気持ちは、演技にも現れていると思うぞ。\nこの調子で頑張ろう！", "zh": "不，我觉得那种心情已经在你的演技中体现出来了。\n就按这个势头继续加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1021_048rei", "source_sha256": "c8faa6fc2282a463d6b54fbea48fc6d48937dd5988c553f6e320dde1f999f45a", "ja": "自分と同じ部分……うーん……。", "zh": "和自己相同的地方……嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1022_p", "source_sha256": "0194837c9c5eede3936ce30ecd4a48df98c8781d818f8f8510cee0a83d494146", "ja": "資料の整理をしてたら遅くなっちゃったな……\n明日は撮影本番だ。そろそろ上がって早く寝ないとな。", "zh": "整理资料整理得晚了啊……\n明天就是正式拍摄了。差不多该下班早点睡了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "124230d845044e2d2c23188390e3e8628e4960276b692a4f90ce5915f1dec108", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです。\nまだ残ってたんですね、良かった♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了。\n你还在这里啊，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "768c38f188617fb657c2838407f54548e4b2373c550ccfcb2f29832518305feb", "ja": "麗花こそ、こんな時間までどうしたんだ？", "zh": "丽花才是，你怎么这么晚还在这里？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1025_048rei", "source_sha256": "7981d98447f98e6fe31f47de0c2cbb3465d5f53cfa73f4645726d415176911e6", "ja": "はい。あの、私……チトセくんと、お友達に\nなりたいんですけど。どうしたらいいと思いますか？", "zh": "嗯。那个，我……想和千岁同学成为朋友，可是要怎么做才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "6a68b50ee43f0caeeef7c83b5900e9586245afadef627f69b24bcb47596ee6b9", "ja": "と、友達？　……というかチトセって、\n麗花が演じてる？", "zh": "朋、朋友？……话说回来，千岁是……丽花在演吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1027_048rei", "source_sha256": "4c10ef52950d4f4ad3ad4c4fe1ea8e7ba2aaedea3ab147766787da374fefac91", "ja": "はい！　私、チトセくんに声をかけてあげたり、\n一緒にドライブに行こうって誘ったりしたいんです。", "zh": "是的！我想主动和千岁君说说话，也想邀请他一起兜风。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1028_048rei", "source_sha256": "5b1025337fbe12a5741243ce428d96f6cdcf4c8ce1f607638ba1aae895764d3c", "ja": "だって、ひとりきりって、寂しいじゃないですか？", "zh": "因为，一个人孤零零的，不是很寂寞吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1030_048rei", "source_sha256": "992e9d7e9c4112f71480442bf29913390278ff5cdd9b3dfd862369330c7574ba", "ja": "初めて脚本を読んだ時からずっと思ってたんです。\n「チトセくん、なんだか寂しそう」って。", "zh": "从第一次读剧本的时候起，我就一直在想。\n“千岁君，总觉得有些寂寞。”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1031_048rei", "source_sha256": "662e38b423cca63354fdaea931b8c6fc18d5bc85702c7d305da7b1991bcb2a8a", "ja": "私、チトセくんが言うみたいな、見下すとか。\nそういうのはよくわかりませんけど……。", "zh": "我嘛，像千岁说的那种，看不起别人什么的。\n那些我不太明白……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1032_048rei", "source_sha256": "c6f8bd2cbf252adcad5ee3bb41c7b325afdaa068d4dd8569fdc5663ed2c0ed8e", "ja": "でも……寂しいって気持ちは、わかりますから。\n誰かのことを、「いいな」って思う気持ちも。", "zh": "但是……寂寞的心情，我还是明白的。\n对某个人产生“真羡慕啊”的想法，我也明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1033_p", "source_sha256": "867c330f093aa33521e6562721ec420ae844873ed37ae80263370f528e7f544b", "ja": "……うん。そうだな。", "zh": "……嗯。是啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1034_048rei", "source_sha256": "9aeea604fe6a84b3b5dfdf30f91364af095d838bc31091b270b1c698ed7f2b80", "ja": "チトセくんは世界中を敵みたいに思っていて、だから\nみんなの事が嫌いで。でも、本当は違うと思うんです。", "zh": "我觉得千岁把全世界都当成了敌人，所以才会讨厌大家。但是，我觉得事实并不是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1035_048rei", "source_sha256": "aca735bd58ccd818be64ca79d923ae3a1dfd6f19000470cf094425f626749b23", "ja": "チトセくんは、誰かの仲間になりたい。みんなのこと、\n好きになりたいんじゃないかなって……。", "zh": "我觉得，千岁应该是想成为某个人的伙伴。想要喜欢上大家……才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1036_p", "source_sha256": "8e1abfc1ce0c92b46b0e19c7026971991212dd7111e18043b53c21c5b4080598", "ja": "麗花……。", "zh": "丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1037_048rei", "source_sha256": "629b9bd25117172c4f49979c3f5acbcc02fe09a07cbce516828320bdb682487e", "ja": "私、チトセくんに教えてあげたいんです。世界の\nどこかに、わかってくれる人が絶対にいるよって。", "zh": "我想告诉千岁，世界上某个地方，一定有能理解他的人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1038_p", "source_sha256": "deef59f36b5542da5e176f24a8dd468086de76a2438433630b32c9632a59c815", "ja": "……だから、「友達になりたい」なんだな。", "zh": "……所以，你是想说“想和它成为朋友”吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1039_048rei", "source_sha256": "125de3e11d22ff6f69f866a3965f3890dec18453f329fd24a64e8459dedc9286", "ja": "でもでも、私とチトセくんは、\n住んでる世界が違うから……。", "zh": "可是可是，我和千岁君，生活在不同的世界里……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1040_048rei", "source_sha256": "f96821a556ca78ff68f838c2e0f0f374f6fbef20eada08d2e60dc48eed7f6b75", "ja": "だから、どうしたら友達になれるのかなって。\nずっと考えてたけど、どうしてもわからないんです。", "zh": "所以，我一直在想，要怎样才能和他成为朋友呢。\n可是无论怎么想，都想不明白。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1041_p", "source_sha256": "bb49e67df33f2e2b004a4e3bc7a8d7e5d7c7cfaed1d770c8497c14da5ce3b982", "ja": "そうだな。それには……麗花が、チトセのことを\nしっかり演じるのが一番なんじゃないかな。", "zh": "是啊。要说这个嘛……最重要的，应该是丽花好好演绎千岁的角色吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1042_048rei", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1043_p", "source_sha256": "11faab3742ee1f6fd511626c5f7411f0266adc5b138642fdf08305d530f3e61b", "ja": "麗花が、チトセは本当はこういう子で、\nこんなふうに寂しさを抱えてる子なんだって……", "zh": "丽花说，千岁其实是这样的孩子，是个把这样的寂寞藏在心里的孩子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1044_p", "source_sha256": "ecf7d9e41b1620d51e6c11936e1667174df5ea14f5a05436c6c206658931eeea", "ja": "他の登場人物や、映画を観てくれる人達に、お芝居で\nわかってもらうんだ。それが一番いいと、俺は思う。", "zh": "我觉得，最好还是通过演出来，让其他登场人物和观看电影的人明白，她其实是这样的孩子，心里还怀抱着这样的寂寞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1045_048rei", "source_sha256": "dd708f1cf3f0477d9fb00ed9f01a1efc20821a0905fb3ca62bebcb76b5f8d7ce", "ja": "私の演技で、チトセくんを知ってもらう……\nそしたら、チトセくんは寂しくなくなる……？", "zh": "通过我的演技，让大家认识千岁……\n这样一来，千岁就不会寂寞了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1046_048rei", "source_sha256": "e6ccd210866d8f3022a1ac098ebb825344bb2f7fe49bb2efdc1816acb25d73f7", "ja": "そっか……そうなんですね。わかりました。それで\nチトセくんが寂しくなくなるなら、私、がんばります！", "zh": "这样啊……原来是这么回事。我明白了。只要这样\n千岁不再寂寞，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1047_048rei", "source_sha256": "39a425632bf7769a6707840392a99c7e5206741d33b3b79f7b68ea8d6db0faff", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nアドバイスありがとうございました！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n谢谢您的建议！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1048_p", "source_sha256": "546dbde987489ffb8dd7a5f140174c5139e66bfb78e058cf9465d088923cd7cf", "ja": "どういたしまして。\n明日からの撮影、頑張ろうな！", "zh": "不客气。\n从明天开始的拍摄，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1049_p", "source_sha256": "045d4ab44a6318573d9154b4182203968d1f5f4f7d1a935b14494233d970d130", "ja": "（麗花は、チトセという人物が感じている寂しさに、\nずっと共感してたんだな……）", "zh": "（原来丽花一直都在对名叫千岁的那个人所感受到的寂寞产生共鸣啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0308_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0308_story_05_1050_p", "source_sha256": "f86931ae78ab844d94d1bd8823ca11238d8a28148d6c29ae1922173426a613a0", "ja": "（寂しさを知るからこそ、それに気づく。\n麗花ならきっと、チトセを演じられるはずだ）", "zh": "（正因为了解孤独，才能察觉到它。丽花的话，一定能演好千岁）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
